# Eyes Open web — environment templates

Use the right template for your environment:

| File | Use case |
|------|----------|
| `.env.anvil.example` | Local coin testing (Anvil 31337) → copy to `.env.local` |
| `.env.production.example` | eyesopen.to / Vercel production → set in host dashboard |
| `.env.staging.example` | Base Sepolia testnet preview (optional) |

**Never set `NEXT_PUBLIC_USE_ANVIL=true` on production or eyesopen.to.**

Quick local:
```powershell
copy web\.env.anvil.example web\.env.local
.\scripts\sync-deploy-to-web.ps1 -Network anvil
```

See `docs/PRODUCTION_CONFIG.md` for the full production fill-in list.
